{"id":"4a4b205829deb176","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-system-t-typing-judgment.md","title":"System T项的可导类型判断","display":"df-system-t-typing-judgment — System T项的可导类型判断","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-system-t-typing-judgment","aliases":["72-df-system-t-typing-judgment"],"display":"df-system-t-typing-judgment — System T项的可导类型判断","depends_on":["[[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]"],"chapter":"V","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.V §§2.2–2.5 print343–351/PDF355–363; explicit local typing interface","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-system-t-typing-judgment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-system-t-typing-judgment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-system-t-typing-judgment — System T项的可导类型判断"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b4e2c27ac178897e\" href=\"?note=b4e2c27ac178897e\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic\">72-df-finite-type-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"V"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.V §§2.2–2.5 print343–351/PDF355–363; explicit local typing interface"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 是有限固有类型上下文，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathcal E_T\">\\(t\\in\\mathcal E_T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathcal{Ty}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathcal{Ty}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_{ty},R_{ty},\\operatorname{Cl}\">\\(U_{ty},R_{ty},\\operatorname{Cl}\\)</span> 使用既有最小规则闭包；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\subseteq\\Delta&#39;\">\\(\\Delta\\subseteq\\Delta&#39;\\)</span> 只比较相容上下文。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\vdash_T^{ty}t:\\sigma\\quad:\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n(\\Delta\\vdash t:\\sigma)\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_{ty}}(R_{ty}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta\\vdash_T^{ty}t:\\sigma\\quad:\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n(\\Delta\\vdash t:\\sigma)\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_{ty}}(R_{ty}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_\\sigma^c=\\{t\\in\\mathcal E_T:\\varnothing\\vdash_T^{ty}t:\\sigma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T_\\sigma^c=\\{t\\in\\mathcal E_T:\\varnothing\\vdash_T^{ty}t:\\sigma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式将原来的判断编码与真正属于类型推导闭包的断言分开。第二式使用类型推导的自由变量性质与加强引理：无自由变量的可类型项可删除整个外部上下文。二者按类型推导归纳，抽象分支先作同类型新鲜改名。常元都有封闭类型公理，不需要保留多余上下文。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b4e2c27ac178897e","anchor":"ref-1","ta